text Naranja_SafariZone_RestHouse_Text_081C3EC9 {
    "I don’t have any オカキクケS, but I caught\na good number of POKéMON.\pYou can improve your chances of making\na catch by getting closer to them\lbefore throwing a SAFARI BALL."
}

text Naranja_SafariZone_RestHouse_Text_081C3F71 {
    "If you use オカキクケS, wild POKéMON won’t\nbe so quick to run away.\pIt’s not much use to give オカキクケS to\nPOKéMON that don’t flee easily."
}

text Naranja_SafariZone_RestHouse_Text_081C3FF4 {
    "If you put a オカキクケ on the FEEDER,\nPOKéMON are attracted to it.\pI think POKéMON with the same sort of\nnature are drawn by a certain オカキクケ."
}
